  "content": {
    "title": "Who died in 'NCIS' Ep. 500? CBS show's tragic love letter (Spoilers!)",
    "text": "Updated March 24, 2026, 11:23 p.m. ETWho saw this tragedy coming on \"NCIS\"? Jimmy Palmer (Brian Dietzen), Timothy McGee (Sean Carroll) and Alden Parker (Gary Cole) react during the 500th \"NCIS\" episode on March 24. Spoilers ahead!CBSOh good lord, it's Director Leon Vance (Rocky Carroll) who seems to be OK after three gunshots to the chest. He was wearing his bulletproof vest. Jimmy Palmer (Brian Dietzen) and Alden Parker (Gary Cole) hold the head of their \"NCIS\" boss.CBSTurns out the mysterious man interviewing Vance was actually the late Dr. Donald \"Ducky\" Mallard, in young version (Adam Campbell). Vance actually wasn't wearing a vest and died from the gunshots. Young Ducky is helping the transition to death.CBSLeon Vance (Rocky Carroll) and Ducky Mallard (David McCallum) on \"NCIS\" in 2014. McCallum died in 2023.Cliff Lipson, CBSDr. Donald “Ducky” Mallard (Adam Campbell) points out the after-life to Director Leon Vance (Rocky Carroll) on \"NCIS.\" Heaven happens to be Vance's assistant's office.CBSVance (Rocky Carroll) eyes the light standing with young Ducky (Adam Campbell). Vance ventures into the light alone and hears his late wife calling for him.CBSIn the final episode for Leon Vance (Rocky Carroll), the NCIS director saved his agency from closing, defused a bomb, got shot, and met Ducky Mallard before going to heaven. That's a day!CBSDucky Mallard (David McCallum), Leon Vance (Rocky Carroll) and Leroy Jethro Gibbs (Mark Harmon) in 2017.Patrick McElhenney, CBSDucky (David McCallum, right) and the team must act fact when a North Korean assassin from Vance's (Rocky Carroll, left) past resurfaces in Washington D.C. to kill again in 2009.SONJA FLEMMING, CBSDirector Leon Vance (Rocky Carroll) during a 2024 episode. He sacrificed for NCIS.Sonja Flemming, CBSNCIS Director Leon Vance (Leon Vance) and FBI Special Agent Alden Parker (Gary Cole) work to stop a terrorist plot in the Season 20 finale.CBSVance (Rocky Carroll, right) partners with Leroy Jethro Gibbs (Mark Harmon, left) and returns to field duty in a 2015 episode when a murder case is connected to a former NCIS agent he locked up for stealing evidence.Monty Brinton, CBSWhen Gibbs' (Mark Harmon) boat is found with two dead mercenaries on board, he, along with Vance (Rocky Carroll) and the team are forced to look at an old friend in a new light in 2009.SONJA FLEMMING, CBSTony DiNozzo (Michael Weatherly, left) with Leon Vance (Rocky Carroll) in 2016.Robert Voets, CBSRocky Carroll directs a \"NCIS\" episode. Carroll will continue to direct episodes.Greg Gayne, CBSRocky Carroll as NCIS Director Leon Vance in Season 18.Bill Inoshita, CBS",
